<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ISLAND VIEW YR SHR DIPS, DIV STEADY.</title>
<headline>ISLAND VIEW YR SHR DIPS, DIV STEADY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   128.9     vs    134.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  51.5     vs     51.5</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    32.8     vs     33.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    48.4     vs     54.8</p>
<p>    Tax			  15.6     vs     21.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  441.4     vs    412.2</p>
<p>Div payable: January 10 1997</p>
<p>On register: December 6</p>
<p>Full name: Island View Holdings Ltd (industrial holding)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said that although economic prospects for</p>
<p>the new year were not generally encouraging, the growth</p>
<p>initiatives undertaken by the group over the last two years were</p>
<p>expected to yield sound real growth in earnings in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
